# Spells that move people or find things, cast by Smokegod (60, every skill at 100, mana to spare) and Heroic (51, a
# warrior, every skill at 100, so a mortal), with only area_update running. Smokegod starts at the entrance to Mud
# School (3700), Decimus (10) in the temple square (3005). Each cast is waited out.
# - gate with no one named, to no one, to Decimus, and to yourself; summon Decimus (who won't be summoned), a drunk,
#   a fido (aggressive), the baker (a shopkeeper) and Cherub (an immortal); teleport yourself; word of recall (and
#   refused when cursed)
# - portal and nexus to Decimus by Smokegod (an immortal needs no component), and by Heroic without and with a warp
#   stone (an amethyst, 3611), which flares and vanishes
# - locate object for golden flutes; ventriloquate, heard by Decimus and Cherub
# - identify on a potion, a scroll, a wand, a staff, a drink, a bag, a sharp sword, a shield and an enchanted sword;
#   recharge on a sword, a wand too high for the caster, one recharged once already, and small wands until one
#   glows, fizzles or explodes
@connect god
Smokegod
smoke123
@return
@return
set skill smokegod all 100
set char smokegod mana 30000
restore smokegod
goto 3700
@connect dec
Decimus
psswrd
@return
@return
south
@connect cher
Cherub
smoke123
@return
@return
@connect hero
Heroic
psswrd
@return
@return
@as god
set skill heroic all 100
set char heroic mana 30000
restore heroic
transfer heroic 3700
transfer cherub 3700
cast gate
@pulse 24
cast gate nobody
@pulse 24
cast gate decimus
@pulse 24
cast gate smokegod
@pulse 24
goto 3700
cast summon decimus
@pulse 24
@mob 3064 3005
cast summon drunk
@pulse 24
@mob 3062 3005
cast summon fido
@pulse 24
cast summon baker
@pulse 24
cast summon cherub
@pulse 24
transfer decimus 3005
cast teleport
@pulse 24
goto 3700
cast 'word of recall'
@pulse 24
goto 3700
cast curse smokegod
@pulse 24
cast 'word of recall'
@pulse 24
cast 'remove curse'
@pulse 24
cast portal decimus
@pulse 24
cast nexus decimus
@pulse 24
@as hero
cast portal decimus
@pulse 24
@obj 3611 3700
get amethyst
hold amethyst
cast portal decimus
@pulse 24
@obj 3611 3700
get amethyst
hold amethyst
cast nexus decimus
@pulse 24
@as god
goto 3700
cast 'locate object' flute
@pulse 24
cast 'locate object' nothingatall
@pulse 24
transfer decimus 3700
cast ventriloquate decimus Hello, everyone.
@pulse 24
cast ventriloquate cherub I love you all.
@pulse 24
